    "expectedRule": "Silent Broadcast Tower tracks three relay consoles (north_relay_console, central_relay_console, south_relay_console) and an integer noise level clamped to 0-6, starting at 0. Entering an unresolved relay console sets it pending; a pending relay blocks departure (广播中继尚未调谐，请先选择静默或播送。) until law/resolve-broadcast-relay chooses mute or broadcast. Mute lowers noise by 1 (by 2 with dead_air_headset equipped, clamped at 0) and pays no reward; broadcast raises noise by 1 (clamped at 6) and pays 180 reward points via applyRunReward to both state.rewardPoints (durable) and state.run.lootBag.rewardPoints (run track). Resolve logs 广播中继已静默：当前噪声 N/6。 or 广播中继已播送：本局奖励点 +180，当前噪声 N/6。. Clearing a dangerous node (monster or trap) raises noise by 1, except the first dangerous clear of the run is muted to 0 when hushblade is equipped (firstClashMutedUsed flips true and the passive reason changes to 断频长刃已抵消首次战斗或陷阱增噪。). Resolving without a pending relay, after all three are resolved, or after the boss snapshot is frozen is rejected as domain-rejected (The command did not produce a domain transition.); re-selecting a cleared console is rejected already-resolved. Entry passives are frozen at run/enter from equipped gear into law.entryPassives (hushblade, deadAirHeadset, anechoicMantle, lastChannelBeacon) and persist across the run and save-codec round-trip. Route gates: broadcast_silent_archive_gate (north_echo_cache to silent_archive) opens only with at least 2 mutes and noise at most 1 (至少静默 2 座中继，且噪声不高于 1。); broadcast_resonance_vault_gate (broadcast_warden_north to resonance_vault) opens only with at least 2 broadcasts and noise at least 4 (至少播送 2 座中继，且噪声不低于 4。); broadcast_balanced_switchboard_gate (soul_recharge_broadcast to balanced_switchboard) opens only when all three relays are resolved and noise is between 2 and 3; broadcast_memory_boss_gate (broadcast_memory_stage to last_broadcaster) opens only when all three relays are resolved. With only three relays, mute>=2 and broadcast>=2 are mutually exclusive, so the silent-archive and resonance-vault gates can never both open in one run. Closed gates remove edges from legal adjacent targets so run/move through them is rejected illegal-move. Starting the last_broadcaster boss combat (run/select-node) with all relays resolved freezes bossNoiseSnapshot = clamp(noise - lastChannelBeacon, 0, 6) and freezes further relay tuning (首领噪声已冻结，不能再调谐中继。); the display appends Boss快照 N. Boss modifiers during the boss encounter derive from the snapshot: at snapshot 0-2 the player gains encounter.defensePercent [12, 8, 4]; at noise 4+ encounter/trap danger and outgoing damage scale up. The boss is a real multi-round combat (monsterHp 1319, bossPhase sealed) with a three-beat finale that deals 16 noise damage on the third beat (4 if guarding). The law display status is 噪声 N/6，北中继:X，中央中继:X，南中继:X，静默 M，播送 B[，待调谐 北中继]，Boss快照 未冻结|N with severity stable/warning/danger/resolved and meter {value: noise, max: 6}; the broadcast-correct API is core.getCurrentBroadcastRelayStatus. Law state, relay choices, noise, entry passives, boss snapshot, and reward points persist through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
